# Fetched from models.dev by `npm run catalog` when a release is built, never committed:
# a snapshot in the tree goes stale the day after, and reads as the source of truth when
# the app's own cache (`<data dir>/cache/models.json`) is. `build.rs` embeds it when it is
# here and embeds nothing when it is not. This file keeps the directory, which `build.rs`
# watches, in every checkout.
models.json
